  "id": "reportability",
  "term": "reportability",
  "definition": "Reportability is whether a person can consciously notice and describe a stimulus. In this context, a stimulus may be unreportable either because attention is directed elsewhere or because the stimulus does not reach conscious perception, such as when it is masked.",
